3. DIAGRAMMES DE SÉQUENCE (plusieurs, complets) :

```plantuml
@startuml Sequence_IP_Demat
!theme plain

actor "Gestionnaire IRC" as Gestionnaire
participant "AuthService\n(Securite)" as Auth
participant "OrchestrationService\n(Technical)" as Orch
participant "ReglesEngineService\n(Technical)" as Rules
participant "IntegrationGCEAdapter\n(Technical)" as GCE
participant "InfogreffeWebServiceAdapter\n(Technical)" as InfoG
participant "TribunalFluxAdapter\n(Technical)" as Trib
participant "StockageDocumentaireService\n(Technical)" as DocStore
participant "IntegrationSIRCAdapter\n(Technical)" as SIRC
participant "AuditService\n(Technical)" as Audit

== Soumission IP dématérialisée (REQ-032/EX-038, REQ-033/EX-039, REQ-041/EX-048) ==
Gestionnaire -> Auth : authenticate()
Auth --> Gestionnaire : boolean

Gestionnaire -> Orch : processData()\nCréer InjonctionDePayer
Orch -> Rules : processData()\nSélection tribunal (REQ-040/EX-047)
Rules --> Orch : Tribunal

Orch -> DocStore : processData()\nAssembler pièces (REQ-033/EX-039)
DocStore --> Orch : OK

Orch -> GCE : processData()\nSynchroniser action manuelle (REQ-029/EX-035)
GCE --> Orch : OK

Orch -> InfoG : processData()\nEnvoyer IP + bordereau + pièces\n(REQ-033/EX-039)
InfoG --> Orch : OK (accusé technique)

Orch -> Audit : processData()\nJournaliser envoi + statut
Audit --> Orch : OK

== Retour quotidien tribunal (REQ-042/EX-049) ==
Trib -> Trib : processData()\nGénérer retour quotidien
Trib -> Trib : validateInput()
Trib -> Orch : processData()\nRetourTribunal(date, reference, statut, motif)
Orch -> Audit : processData()\nJournaliser retour
Audit --> Orch : OK

Orch -> GCE : processData()\nMise à jour état si action requise (REQ-039/EX-046)
GCE --> Orch : OK

Orch -> SIRC : processData()\nTransfert documentaire quotidien (REQ-002/EX-002, REQ-013/EX-019)
SIRC --> Orch : OK

@enduml
```

```plantuml
@startuml Sequence_IP_Rejet_Regeneration
!theme plain

actor "Gestionnaire IRC" as Gestionnaire
participant "AuthService\n(Securite)" as Auth
participant "OrchestrationService\n(Technical)" as Orch
participant "TransformationControleFluxService\n(Technical)" as Ctrl
participant "ReprocessingService\n(Technical)" as Reproc
participant "InfogreffeWebServiceAdapter\n(Technical)" as InfoG
participant "AuditService\n(Technical)" as Audit
participant "IntegrationGCEAdapter\n(Technical)" as GCE

== Rejet + correction + régénération IP (REQ-034/EX-040, REQ-043/EX-050, REQ-044/EX-051) ==
Gestionnaire -> Auth : authenticate()
Auth --> Gestionnaire : boolean

Gestionnaire -> Orch : processData()\nOuvrir Rejet (motif)
Orch -> Ctrl : processData()\nQualifier rejet + responsabilité (REQ-044/EX-051)
Ctrl --> Orch : OK

alt Rejet imputable prestataire (REQ-044/EX-051)
  Orch -> Reproc : processData()\nRégénération idempotente
  Reproc --> Orch : Flux régénéré
  Orch -> InfoG : processData()\nRéémettre IP corrigée
  InfoG --> Orch : OK
else Rejet imputable gestionnaire (REQ-043/EX-050)
  Orch --> Gestionnaire : Demander Correction guidée
  Gestionnaire -> Orch : processData()\nSoumettre Correction
  Orch -> GCE : processData()\nSynchroniser action manuelle (REQ-029/EX-035)
  GCE --> Orch : OK
  Orch -> InfoG : processData()\nRéémettre IP corrigée
  InfoG --> Orch : OK
end

Orch -> Audit : processData()\nJournaliser rejet/correction/réémission
Audit --> Orch : OK

@enduml
```

```plantuml
